  "pedal": "Boss PH-3 Phase Shifter — Depth in Rise and Fall (mono)",
  "comment": "In Rise and Fall Depth doesn't change the speed, but it changes the notches and the level: at 7:00 and 12:00 shallow notches and 2-6 dB over bypass, at 5:00 deep notches near bypass level (the study: Rise and Fall). Here Rise's nine tones at each of Depth's five positions — the same take five times with only Depth turned a step: the law — then the guitar at Depth 5:00 (the setting NAM-X's Rise was fitted at) and Fall at 5:00 (7:00 was recorded in the focused session). Clock positions: 7:00 = fully counter-clockwise, 5:00 = fully clockwise; 9:00 and 3:00 pointer horizontal.",
